<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`核心层之外还有一圈外围模块。它们有个共同点：既能被框架使用，也能单独当作工具库引入。

按用途大致分三拨。工具类是 f_base、f_util、f_collection、f_concurrent、f_io、f_crypto、f_random，还有 f_time、f_regex、f_rx。协议与存储这一类是 f_http、f_net、f_protocol、f_store、fleet、f_rpc。另外还有 f_llm、f_egraph、f_codec、f_mockdb 这些偏领域的模块，它们不在今天的核心链路里，需要时单独看文档。

引用方式有两种写法，完全等价。一种是在 cjpm.toml 里写 fountain::f_orm 等于版本号，另一种是用聚合包 fountain::fountain.orm。对应的包名分别是 fountain::f_orm 点什么、和 fountain::fountain.orm 点什么。两种都可以，团队里统一一种即可。

版本号方面：fountain 各模块版本一致，可以在仓库 README 或者 f_version 模块里查。安装 fboot 也是同样一条 cjpm install 命令。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 1 章 · 为什么使用 fountain · 1.2 续</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>外围模块与引用方式</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>核心层之外的一圈</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 330, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>外围模块</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12 }}>工具类：f_base f_util f_collection f_concurrent f_io f_crypto f_random f_time f_regex f_rx</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>协议与存储：f_http f_net f_protocol f_store fleet f_rpc</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>领域模块：f_llm f_egraph f_codec f_mockdb</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 'auto' }}>既能被框架使用，也能单独当工具库引入</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>引用方式</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 10 }}>在项目根 cjpm.toml 里加依赖</Text>
        <Box style={{ background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 16, marginTop: 12 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.9, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>
            <>[dependencies]<br />"fountain::f_orm" = "a.b.c"</>
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 14 }}>把 a.b.c 换成实际版本号，各模块版本一致。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 'auto' }}>两种引用方式完全等价，团队内统一一种。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>包名规则</Text>
        <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>直接包名</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>fountain::f_orm.*</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>聚合包</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>fountain::fountain.orm.*</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 'auto' }}>聚合包把同一模块挂在统一命名空间下，迁移时少改 import。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(56,189,248,0.06)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 24 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 56, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>安装启动器：cjpm install "fountain::fboot"="【版本号】" --root ~/.cjpm</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 6 }}>版本号可在仓库 README 或 f_version 模块查看。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>08 / 116</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
